  "title": "NON–ABELIAN REIDEMEISTER TORSION FOR TWIST KNOTS",
  "authors_raw": "JÉR ÔME DUBOIS, VU HUYNH, AND YOSHIKAZU YAMAGUCHI",
  "title_lines": [
   "NON–ABELIAN REIDEMEISTER TORSION FOR TWIST KNOTS"
  ],
  "abstract": "This paper gives an explicit formula for the SL 2(C)−non–abelian Reidemeister torsion as deﬁned in [Dub06] in the case of twist knots. For hyperbolic twist knots, we also prove that the non–abelian Reidemeister torsion at the holonomy representation can be expressed as a rational function evaluated at the cusp shape of the knot.",
