  "title_evidence": {
   "heading": "NON–ABELIAN REIDEMEISTER TORSION FOR TWIST KNOTS 1. I ntroduction Twist knots form a family of special two–bridge knots which include the trefoil knot and the ﬁgure eight knot. The knot group of a two–bridge knot has a particularly nice presentation with only two generators and a single relation. On",
   "outline": "1. Introduction",
   "text": "NON–ABELIAN REIDEMEISTER TORSION FOR TWIST KNOTS",
